Advertising Sales Prediction is a machine learning project that predicts sales based on advertising expenditure on different channels 
such as TV, Radio, and Newspaper.The project involves analysing the relationship between advertising spending and sales,
creating visualisations, and training machine learning models such as Linear Regression to predict sales.
The models are evaluated using MAE, RMSE, and R² score. 
The project also identifies which advertising channel has the highest impact on sales
